WEBVTT

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:10.420
Takashiro-san invited me to stay at the
Giou Clan's Kamakura residence.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.170
If I'm being invited to the primary residence,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:21.590
he may be planning to tell me
about the upcoming war.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.650
Only Yuki-sama has been called
to the main house?

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.140
Yes, by Takashiro's orders.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:37.350
If Hotsu finds out, we'll
have a lot to deal with.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:39.860
That's true. In that case...

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:48.000
Master, a butterfly!
It's beautiful.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.380
Wait for me!

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:57.030
I want to know what happened
in our previous lives.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:01.050
I want to know why we fight.

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.510
I want to know more about Luka.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:08.640
I'm sure I'll find the answers in Kamakura...

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:21.610
Only I know your pain...

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.120
Your uncertainty...

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:27.080
Your loneliness...

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:32.340
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:38.590
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:48.850
I will not betray you!

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:33.780
After Determination...

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:37.240
Hurry, everyone! Breakfast's ready!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:42.240
Come on, now! Sit down!

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.460
Up playing games again?

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:47.460
No.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.940
How about you, Toko-chan?
Did you sleep well?

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:50.960
I'm fine.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:53.350
What about you?
Are you feeling okay?

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:54.090
Yes.

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:56.680
I don't want to go to school...

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:58.870
Uh-oh.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:02.090
I need to get them on their
way to school soon.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:03.680
Good morning.

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:07.850
Would you like coffee or tea?

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.710
I'll have some tea.

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:10.940
I'll have coffee.

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:11.950
Don't we have any cola?

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.250
I'd like some café au lait.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:17.870
Please hurry, everyone.
We don't have much time.

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.110
Okay!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.030
Nice one, Aya-chan!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.600
Where's Yuki-chan?

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:27.390
That's odd. Yuki doesn't usually sleep in.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.250
Now that you mention it, that's right.

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:31.640
I'll go wake him.

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:33.960
Don't worry about him!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:34.460
Huh?

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:37.360
Yuki-kun's already up, so there's
no need to worry!

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:38.430
Don't worry about him!

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.490
I see...

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:44.850
Good morning.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.770
You're still not dressed?

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:51.380
You'll be late.

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:55.010
Oh, I'm not going to school today.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:55.900
What?

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:56.820
Why not?

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.730
Are you feeling unwell?

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.460
Do your injuries still hurt?

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.220
No, uh, I...

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:05.730
That's right, you've been
through a lot lately.

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:08.320
You should rest today, just to be safe.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:10.050
Then I'll take the day off, too.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:10.620
What?

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.600
If Yuki's going to be here,
he'll need protection.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:15.470
Exactly.

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:17.100
I'll stay, too.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.880
If Toko-chan's taking the day off, so will I.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.340
You can't!

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:24.550
You all have to go to school!
You've got exams coming up!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.290
What are you talking about?

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:27.990
Exams are nowhere near as
important as keeping Yuki safe-

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:28.810
Hotsu!

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.830
Wh-What is it?

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:34.150
Don't you have too many absences already?

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:36.890
We should be fine, though.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:40.490
Unlike Hotsuma, we're honor roll
students with perfect records.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:41.110
That's right.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:44.700
So you can leave Yuki-chan to us-

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:47.090
Hey! This isn't your decision to make!

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:50.390
Come on! Going to school is
one of your responsibilities.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:52.050
We haven't eaten breakfast yet...

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:53.780
You don't usually eat it, do you?

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:55.340
Something isn't right.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.710
What's all this fuss for?

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:00.240
He is acting rather suspicious.

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.940
Quite suspicious.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:03.750
Suspicious indeed.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.710
Oh, come on.

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.280
Nothing's going on, I swear.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.900
What's gotten into all of you?

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:13.430
Cut it out, already!
We know it's just an act!

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.610
I'm not lying...

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.840
Give it up!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:18.140
Tell us! Tell us! What are you hiding?

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.340
You're making me sick!

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:21.240
Takashiro-sama told you something...

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:23.870
Takashiro-sama.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.700
Tachibana...

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:35.000
Why would you lie to us like that?

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.330
I'm sorry.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:41.720
Yuki-chan, will you tell us what happened?

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:43.170
Please, Yuki.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:49.340
The truth is, Takashiro-san invited me
to the primary residence in Kamakura.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.220
Takashiro-sama did?

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.780
But why only you?

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:55.310
He must be up to something.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:57.950
What could he have in mind?

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:00.110
I don't know.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.670
I'm going, too!

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:04.990
You can't!

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:08.450
Yuki-kun was instructed to go alone.

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:12.500
Why? Aren't we here to protect Yuki?

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.240
I won't let Yuki go by himself!

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:15.420
He won't be alone.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:20.010
I'll go with him, and Luka-kun will protect him.

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:22.520
In addition,

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:26.300
a Zweilt is coming from the primary residence
to meet us, in case the enemy attacks.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.540
I bet it's Kuroto.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:33.580
You expect me to trust that
arrogant brat to look after Yuki?

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:36.980
Hotsuma, we should do as
Takashiro-sama says.

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:38.860
Why should we, Tsukumo?

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:41.110
We can follow them secretly later.

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.320
Oh, right...

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:45.070
How does this sound?

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:47.690
We'll decide who follows them
with rock-paper-scissors.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:48.490
Sounds great!

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:50.210
No! That sounds terrible!

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:52.250
Just hurry up and go to school!

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:53.490
Shut up!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:55.420
I'm trying to concentrate.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:57.690
Hotsuma, let's go to school.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:07:58.960
What are you talking about?

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:03.410
You need to take notes for
Yuki while he's gone.

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.010
Notes?

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:09.940
That's right. We can't let this absence
affect Yuki-kun's grades.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:13.810
As his classmate, you're the only
one who can support him!

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:15.060
The only one?

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:19.480
That's right. It's your job to save Yuki-kun!

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.580
It's my job to save Yuki.

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:29.200
Only I can do it!

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:33.470
Come on, Shusei!
We're going to school!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.360
What a moron.

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:36.040
So stupid.

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:38.460
Who are you calling stupid?

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:39.960
Oh, did you hear that?

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:43.120
My ears are as good as Tsukumo's God's Ears!

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:45.800
Yuki.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.970
You'll come back soon, won't you?

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:54.160
Yes.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:58.560
This is my home.

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:11.230
Good morning, Sodom.

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:13.950
Are you ready to go?

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:15.090
Yes.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:17.160
Tachibana, where are our escorts?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:19.120
They should be here soon.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:35.600
It's been a while, Sen-kun.

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:37.170
Long time no see.

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:41.060
I'm sorry we've been out of touch for so long.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:44.180
I'm sorry as well.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:45.560
It's good to see you, too, Zess.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.280
Or should I call you Luka instead?

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:52.700
Yuki-kun?

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:56.800
It's nice to meet you.
I'm Furuori Senshiro.

00:09:56.800 --> 00:10:00.000
I'll be accompanying you to the
Kamakura residence today.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:04.570
Nice to meet you. I'm Giou Yuki.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.900
Thanks for coming with us.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:08.960
Oh, excuse me.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:09.420
Ouch, I'm sorry...

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.650
Klutz

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:14.480
Not at all. I'm so sorry...

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:17.890
I'm sure you klutzes will get along just fine.

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:26.390
Uh, Furuori-san...

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:29.840
Call me Senshiro.

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:34.610
Senshiro-san, you're a Zweilt... Aren't you?

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.910
Actually, I'm still in training.

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.910
This will be my first time
working among Zweilts.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:42.090
I see.

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:45.170
Sen-kun is the first real talent
we've seen in a while.

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:53.760
It takes natural ability, painstaking training,
and nerves of steel to become a Zweilt.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:57.460
Sen-kun has all three.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.510
Really?

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:02.770
It's not such a big deal.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:06.480
This man fights with weapons.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:10.620
I was willing to do whatever
it took to become a Zweilt.

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:16.410
Oh, that's right.

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:20.200
I hope you don't mind picking
someone up on the way.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.060
Oh, sure.

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:24.600
We'll be going to meet my partner.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:25.870
Your partner?

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:28.740
You might know him.

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:32.880
They made quite a fuss when he was named
the youngest professional shogi player.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:37.890
What? You mean child prodigy
Horai Kuroto-kun?

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:41.560
Can't we convince you to reconsider?

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:45.100
Just give it some more thought.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:50.510
You're the jewel of the shogi world.
You're nearly a 6 dan player.

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:55.400
I'm sorry. But I will never play shogi again.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.950
That's preposterous! You're a prodigy!

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:00.760
You're just starting your career!

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:03.700
No one will think any worse of you.
Just reconsider your choice.

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:05.540
No.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:07.660
I've already made my decision.

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:11.030
Uh-oh...

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:14.170
Looks like Kuroto's in some
kind of an argument.

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:17.420
I'll go check on him.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:27.610
Luka, do you know Senshiro-san?

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:29.020
Yes.

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:32.170
They're back.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.770
Yuki-kun, this is Horai Kuroto.

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:48.710
Nice to meet you. I'm Giou Yuki.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:54.090
Kuroto...

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:08.270
Kuroto-kun, you're amazing.

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:09.520
I can't believe you're a professional
shogi player.

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:11.880
I just quit.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.430
Really?

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:16.440
Yeah.

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:17.860
What a shame!

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:21.450
Did you really have to do that?

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:24.410
It wasn't an easy decision to make.

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:29.450
But both shogi and the fight ahead
require my full attention.

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:35.190
The life of professional shogi
player Horai Kuroto is over.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:40.590
I will devote the rest of my
life to hunting Duras.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:46.600
You should prepare yourself, too.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:24.290
Any time now...

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:29.980
Takashiro-sama, it's time.

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:38.110
I've been waiting for you, Fuyutoki.

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:41.490
Are you cold?

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:42.900
I'm fine.

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:46.930
It's this ritual that's a pain.

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:48.700
Quit whining.

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:54.560
The ritual requires that you
purify your body in holy water

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.400
three times, as the moon rises.

00:14:57.770 --> 00:15:01.100
I know it's the proper etiquette
before asking for divine prophecy,

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:03.820
but this holy water is far too cold.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:05.880
Let's get you warmed up.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:09.470
I could use some hot sake.

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.600
Surely you're joking.

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:16.250
You cannot consume sake, meat,
or fish for another day.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:19.480
I can, however, serve you all
the hot milk you can drink.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:24.360
You're the only one who
treats me like a child.

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:27.990
Takashiro-sama!

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.660
Are you all right?
I'll get your medicine!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:34.720
It's fine. This always happens.

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:36.920
It'll pass soon enough.

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:39.310
Takashiro-sama.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:43.590
Don't look at me like that, Fuyutoki...

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:52.940
Listen, don't tell anyone about this.

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:56.980
I know I'm asking you to
share a heavy burden, but...

00:15:56.980 --> 00:16:01.690
I consider it an unexpected pleasure.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:07.140
As your butler, to be able
to share your pain...

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:11.530
I am proud to serve you as a
member of the Kureha family.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:14.600
You exaggerate.

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:18.120
Try to treat Yuki the same way.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.160
Yes.

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:23.360
I feel terrible for him.

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:31.470
I will probably continue to hurt Yuki.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:33.150
Takashiro-sama...

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:41.630
I have done everything to end this
war of over a thousand years.

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:44.910
I thought I was doing the right thing...

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:50.880
But Yuki calls forth human emotions in me.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:54.950
He makes me remember
things I had forgotten.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:17:01.270
I decided to tell Yuki the truth
because I couldn't take it any more.

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:08.090
I can't continue deceiving him,
when he thinks of me as his own brother.

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:11.310
I am weak.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:13.410
No.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:18.580
You are kind,

00:17:20.090 --> 00:17:21.410
my master.

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.400
Hotsuma, did you take notes?

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:33.200
Yeah, I copied everything down for Yuki.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:38.650
Shusei, what do you think
Takashiro will tell Yuki?

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:45.580
Yuki knew Reiga... Yuki was reborn a man...

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.460
Something's wrong.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:52.170
Something may be different this time.

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:55.660
What's wrong?

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:59.660
I thought I heard Yuki's voice.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:03.990
I probably just imagined it.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:09.150
I didn't think he wanted to
be by his side so much...

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.150
Yuki-chan...

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.160
This place is huge.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.340
It is the primary residence.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.620
You may find it a little different
from the Twilight Mansion.

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:29.340
Luka?

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:32.170
I can only come this far.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.270
I'll be going ahead.

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:38.640
Let's go, Sen-kun.

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:45.020
What do you mean?

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:49.880
There are those who would not want
me to enter the primary residence.

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:52.160
What? But why?

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:54.570
Because I am a Duras.

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.450
I'm sorry.

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:09.460
I'm sorry all I ever do is worry you.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:15.820
But I need to find out who I am...

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:20.450
Why I was born with these powers...

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:23.590
And...

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:31.090
Don't worry.

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.790
It will be all right.

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:37.830
Yes...

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:49.290
I'm sorry, Luka.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:53.580
We can't be happy together.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.010
I can't...

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.870
I love you, Luka.

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:07.790
If all your memories return, I...

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:10.100
Yuki.

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:25.090
Yuki-sama.

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:31.290
Nice to meet you.

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:35.740
I am the butler employed here,
at the primary residence.

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:38.130
My name is Kureha Fuyutoki.

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:41.190
Enjoy your stay.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.440
Nice to meet you. I'm Giou Yuki.

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:47.810
Thank you for your hospitality.

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:57.210
Welcome, Yuki-sama, to the
Giou primary residence.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:03.070
You said your name was Kureha...

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:08.870
The girl who served you at the Twilight
Mansion is my younger sister.

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:11.620
I see.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:16.310
Please wait here.

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:19.460
We'll be going now.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.220
You can do it, Yuki-kun.

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:23.610
Okay.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.360
It's all right.

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:49.830
Thank you for coming, Yuki.

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:52.280
Takashiro-san.

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:38.300
Sodom, what are you doing?

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:41.310
Are you cleaning for us?

00:23:41.760 --> 00:23:45.940
Amazing! Your body just sucks up dust.

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:46.770
Frozen Time

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:49.060
We'll have to give you a bath later!
Frozen Time

00:23:49.060 --> 00:23:49.850
Frozen Time
